        "birth_date": null,
        "summary": "Hey \ud83d\udc4b  I\u2019m Alex. \n\nI like the early stages; no playbook, just a vision and a lot to figure out.\n\nI\u2019m a marketer by title but a builder at heart. I've worked across product, strategy, and analytics to architect GTM motions that actually work. That usually means finding the story that resonates, turning it into programs that drive traction, and leveraging data to stay focused on what matters.\n\nMost of my experience is in cybersecurity, helping startups grow from $0 to over $100M in ARR. I\u2019ve done the work\u2014positioning, launches, demand, partnerships, analyst relations. But, my alpha is bringing clarity in the chaos, and creating momentum where there was none."
